                     Designed as a sidebar (list of available
                     modules) + content panel.  Phase 9 lists only
                     "External Notification"; Phases 10/11 add
                     rows.  ExternalNotification form: switch for
                     enabled, spinner for nag_timeout (the
                     "actually fix the beep" knob), spinners for
                     output_ms, output / output_vibra /
                     output_buzzer GPIO pins, switch for active
                     (active-high vs active-low), alert_message /
                     _vibra / _buzzer + alert_bell / _vibra /
                     _buzzer switches, use_pwm switch,
                     use_i2s_as_buzzer switch; single Apply
                     button at the bottom.
                 (f) ABI: PnMeshState is private to the dialog;
                     no plugin ABI bump.

    [x] Phase 10 MQTT module.  The Modules-sidebar plan was
                 superseded by the 7-tab + GtkExpander layout
