                 fields to proto3 zero.  UI: pn-mesh-page-mqtt.
                 {c,h} mirrors the External Notification page --
                 master Enabled gates the detail fields,
                 password entry has visibility=FALSE, address &
                 root entries grow to fill the row.  Field 6
                 (json_enabled) is upstream-deprecated and
                 intentionally NOT written -- the firmware
                 ignores it.

    [-] Phase 11 Remaining modules.  POSTPONED to a later
                 revision (decided 2026-05-28).  No donor code
                 in pip-mesh; each module is a fresh page on the
                 Phase 10 pattern, and none of the leftovers are
                 must-haves for the unbox-to-test-message goal.
                 Candidates if/when this comes back:
                 Serial (Network tab); Neighbor Info, Detection
                 Sensor, Range Test, Paxcounter (Telemetry tab);
